<td id="xdx_F0B_ztWbD9rKPwua" style="width: 15pt; text-align: right"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">*</span></td><td style="text-align: justify"><span id="xdx_F15_z5WnpgaUJdnf" style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><ix:footnote id="Footnote001481" xml:lang="en-US">Only convertible ratably
