  </table>

</ix:nonNumeric><p id="xdx_8A9_ztBobF3alWA7" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2022-07-01to2023-03-31" escape="true" name="us-gaap:LesseeOperatingLeaseLiabilityMaturityTableTextBlock"><p id="xdx_89E_eus-gaap--LesseeOperatingLeaseLiabilityMaturityTableTextBlock_zwagxRLPRa15" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Remaining
future minimum lease payments under the non-cancelable operating lease at March 31, 2023 are as follows:</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;<span id="xdx_8BD_zqtTAFTJycIe" style="display: none">SCHEDULE
OF FUTURE MINIMUM LEASE PAYMENTS</span></span></p>

