<ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2022-07-01to2023-03-31" escape="true" name="us-gaap:ScheduleOfDerivativeLiabilitiesAtFairValueTableTextBlock"><p id="xdx_892_eus-gaap--ScheduleOfDerivativeLiabilitiesAtFairValueTableTextBlock_zEfJsjKcOH42" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The
following is a roll forward for the nine months ended March 31, 2023 of the fair value liability of price adjustable derivative instruments:</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">&#160;<span style="font-size: 10pt"><span id="xdx_8B8_zR1SSJ4B5Qgh" style="display: none">SCHEDULE
OF DERIVATIVE LIABILITIES AT FAIR VALUE</span></span></span></p>

<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%">
  <tr style="vertical-align: bottom">
